    <subfield code="a">Colección del San Juan.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Consists of a sheet of coarse brown paper (approximately 30 x 100 cm, folded to 33 x 30 cm) on which is pasted the figure of a woman in a long skirt. The face of the figure is a tab that opens to reveal the word "olvido." Beneath the skirt is a second folded sheet (approximately 15 x 45 cm) containing a poem by Juan Luis Hernández Milián in memory of poet Eliseo Diego. With twine loop for hanging. First published to coincide with Alzheimer's Action Day, September 21, 2013.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
